{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"73634012331011efc2dcd10c84d08b762c12503083ea5fadcb2d7458a7f5485b","ja":"大掃除は終わったけど……？","zh":"大扫除虽然结束了……？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4950537da5184b796be93c5a95936e8814da6851b00b1a195e1bd1a4fee247c5","ja":"あとはドアの溝を拭いてー、っと……よし！\nウチらが掃除する場所は、これで終わりだよな？","zh":"然后再把门缝擦一擦——好了！\n我们要打扫的地方，这样就都弄完了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1e3314ccff96b59833f694120beaddb1f5f244da8741f64793d7f649ebf58e24","ja":"はい♪　お疲れさまでした～。なんだか\n劇場の空気まで、いつもより綺麗になった気がします。","zh":"好♪辛苦了～。总觉得连剧场的空气都比平时更加清新了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8063195779bf2f351867cdd7971ca38bf844e12e2690db2d948f69b6059228d1","ja":"ふふっ、そうね。\nじゃあ次は、他の子たちのお手伝いに行く？　","zh":"呵呵，说得也是。\n那么接下来，要去帮其他孩子吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"95fa6265da5876fbc34e2adb42351b1cd17c506943d94fbd185da2267c285e90","ja":"あたしもそう思って、さっきちょっと様子見て\nきたんだけど、もうみんな終わりそうだったよ。","zh":"我也这么想，刚才去稍微看了一下，大家好像都快结束了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"4bfe40776c90d712087125ed105ce71b14d961d01f7bc89c4c9cee2b0f4f2972","ja":"そうなの？　みんな頑張ってくれたのね。じゃあ\n私たちは掃除用具を屋上まで干しにいきましょうか。","zh":"是这样吗？大家都努力过了呢。那么，我们把清洁用具拿到屋顶晾一晾吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0eb0b9a032201fdb7c22c8ea89d4feea631a5b9e35cd67e14ce7edd4031699f9","ja":"ああ……って、ん？　そういや、あの奥の部屋は\nいいのか？　誰も掃除してないよな？","zh":"啊……等等，嗯？说起来，里面那间房没问题吗？没人打扫吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d00ba6a1d3724895d5a7f108eb75743b400dd9b4721a9e35cd8d4c1ccc875909","ja":"あ……ええと、あそこは●●●●プロデューサーが\n「絶対に開けないように」って……。","zh":"啊……那个，●●●●制作人说过……“绝对不要打开”……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"21ea13f83016b8748e0c0b45f14cc07d0db637023d0ed231a68c4510ec1771c9","ja":"へえ……妙だよな？\n開けちゃいけない部屋、なんて。","zh":"哦……真奇怪啊？\n居然还有不能打开的房间。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ceb2f751ed42764c21c9016fcbedc545b7c7dddbe1c675ea4c7fb722ebbd771a","ja":"はい。それに理由も教えてもらってなくて……。","zh":"是的。而且我还没被告知理由……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"374da420f20225bd8854d1810a894e509bcebb799b04e9b9f21f48aeba79cdee","ja":"……隠されると、余計に気になっちゃうわよね。\n指紋を残さなきゃバレないかしら？","zh":"……越是藏起来，就越让人在意呢。\n只要不留下指纹，应该就不会被发现吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7d5f232f0c24454109380f3e79b7fe93d07bdf6f615c561d282b4f20251cb727","ja":"こ、このみさん！\nダメですよぅ～。","zh":"木、木乃美姐！  \n不行啦～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"97b140f0ffb3fa8d6fa289183ab39c496cf91ecfede5713c60bad684a85d2b8f","ja":"なんて、冗談よ♪　●●●●プロデューサーに、あとで\nこっそり聞いてみましょう。じゃあ、そろそろ……。","zh":"开玩笑的♪ 之后偷偷去问问●●●●制作人吧。那么，也差不多该……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"381741c06f05715d309c596195f81d68815d2a8091ab08198d866da978f5ed84","ja":"ガタガタッ……！","zh":"咔哒咔哒……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_978.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"11bb61d351a418e15ae7f701dbac3a7ab31c4ea55cb44e6d8aceb21a47ff80a0","ja":"ひっ？　あ、あの部屋から、\n変な音が……！？","zh":"咦？从、从那个房间里，传来了奇怪的声音……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
